Package: gnome-shell
Version: @DEB_GNOME-SHELL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell
Depends: gjs, libgjs0, libmutter-14-0 (>= 46.0+ios7), libgtk-4-1, libgtk-3-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libgnome-desktop-4-2, gsettings-desktop-schemas, dconf, dbus, libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatspi2.0-0, libgcr-4-4, libpolkit-agent-1-0, libpolkit-gobject-1-0, libibus-1.0-5, libstartup-notification0, libpulse0, libgtkintl
Description: GNOME Shell for the Xios desktop
 GNOME Shell 46 built for rootless iOS against libmutter-14. Calendar
 integration (evolution-data-server) is disabled in this build; the St and
 Shell introspection typelibs are generated on-device after installation.
